      "id": "provider-and-credential-gateway",
      "currentObservableOperations": [
        "configure a Provider-neutral model route using a credential reference",
        "resolve the long-lived credential only inside the Control Plane",
        "stream encoded model data and stable redacted failures without sending a secret to Worker"
